@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us - Bored but Broke</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/aboutus.css" />
    <script src="js/facts.js"></script>
</HeadContent>

<div class="about-mosaic">
    <div class="mosaic-top">
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/London Eye.png" alt="London Eye" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>London Eye</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Buckingham Palace.png" alt="Buckingham Palace" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Buckingham Palace</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/The Shard.png" alt="The Shard" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>The Shard</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Stonehenge.png" alt="Stonehenge" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Stonehenge</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mosaic-banner">
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Lake District.png" alt="Lake District" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Lake District</span></div>
        </div>
        <p>What if going out didn't mean checking your bank app afterwards?</p>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Man O'War Beach.jpg" alt="Man O'War Beach" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Man O'War Beach</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mosaic-bottom">
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Natural History Museum.png" alt="Natural History Museum" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Natural History Museum</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Alton Towers.png" alt="Alton Towers" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Alton Towers</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Snow Centre Manchester.png" alt="Snow Centre Manchester" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Snow Centre Manchester</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mosaic-img-wrapper">
            <img src="About Us Images/Authur's Seat.png" alt="Authur's Seat" />
            <div class="mosaic-overlay"><span>Authur's Seat</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
    <h1>About Us</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Bored But Broke was created for anyone who wants a great day out without spending a fortune.
    </p>

    <p>
        We know the feeling. It's the weekend, you want to do something to relieve your boredom, but you know you don't have enough money! That's where we come in. Enter your location, pick an age range and what you're comfortable spending, and we'll pull together a full day plan tailored for you.
    </p>

    <p>
        We use real-time weather data to find activities that actually make sense. Outdoor options when the sun's out, indoor alternatives when it's rainy or too cold.
    </p>

    <div class="facts-carousel">
        <button class="facts-arrow" onclick="changeFact(-1)">&#8249;</button>
        <div class="facts-text">
            <p id="fact-display"></p>
        </div>
        <button class="facts-arrow" onclick="changeFact(1)">&#8250;</button>
    </div>

    <h2>Our Goal</h2>
    <p>
        To prove that having a fun time doesn't require a big budget. Whether you're a student, a family, or you're just on a budget, there's always something worth doing nearby.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">The Team</h2>
    <p>
        We're a group of four developers (<strong>Yumna, Michelle, Chris & Saran</strong>) who built this as a project at Northcoders. We got tired of Googling "free things to do near me" and not finding anything exciting and end up staying bored at home.
    </p>
</div>

